  subtitle: 'Protecting Your Building Through Its First Seasons and for Years to Come',
  description: 'How the Appalachian Sheds 30-Year Structural Warranty and homeowner maintenance work together: what to do at completion, the first rain and each year, warranty vs. maintenance, records to keep and when to call.',
