        { title: 'Warranty Communication', text: 'If something looks structural or unusual, photograph and date it, then contact Appalachian Sheds before attempting a repair or change.' },
      ],
      note: 'Unsure whether an issue is maintenance or warranty? Document it first and ask before altering the structure.',
